{
 "version": 1,
 "_comment": [
  "An ivy-clad stone arcade (spec 11.51). 24 'n'-profile ribs at a 1.4 m pitch,",
  "with 0.9 m gaps between them -- the gaps are the point, since they are what",
  "let the sun in as the vertical streaks the reference is built around.",
  "",
  "The sun sits ACROSS the tunnel rather than down it. Down the axis the gaps",
  "are edge-on and let nothing through; across it, each gap is a slot and the",
  "wall opposite gets a band."
 ],
